The driver provides support for the Sun Serial/Parallel Interface
card  (Sun  part  number  501‐1931), which is based on the Cirrus
Logic CD180 octal serial controller and  the  Cirrus  Logic  PPC2
parallel port controller.  The device minor numbers for this dri‐
ver are encoded as follows:
